"https://miqllcwiki.com/blog/how-to-create-a-wikipedia-page-for-your-company\",\"mainEntityOfPage\":{\"@type\":\"WebPage\",\"@id\":\"https://miqllcwiki.com/blog/how-to-create-a-wikipedia-page-for-your-company#webpage\"},\"author\":{\"@type\":\"Organization\",\"@id\":\"https://miqllcwiki.com/#organization\",\"name\":\"MIQ LLC\"},\"publisher\":{\"@type\":\"Organization\",\"@id\":\"https://miqllcwiki.com/#organization\",\"name\":\"MIQ LLC\",\"logo\":{\"@type\":\"ImageObject\",\"url\":\"https://miqllcwiki.com/favicon.svg\"}},\"datePublished\":\"2026-11-10\",\"dateModified\":\"2026-11-10\",\"inLanguage\":\"en-US\",\"isPartOf\":{\"@id\":\"https://miqllcwiki.com/#website\"},\"keywords\":[\"how to create a Wikipedia page for your company\",\"Wikipedia page creation\",\"company Wikipedia page\",\"Wikipedia consulting\",\"Wikipedia notability\"],\"hasPart\":{\"@type\":\"FAQPage\",\"mainEntity\":[{\"@type\":\"Question\",\"name\":\"Can my company pay someone to create a Wikipedia page?\",\"acceptedAnswer\":{\"@type\":\"Answer\",\"text\":\"Paid help may be used for research, drafting guidance, or consulting, but paid-contribution and conflict-of-interest expectations should be handled transparently. Payment does not guarantee publication, approval, or retention.\"}},{\"@type\":\"Question\",\"name\":\"What if my company does not have enough media coverage?\",\"acceptedAnswer\":{\"@type\":\"Answer\",\"text\":\"If independent reliable coverage is limited, the company may not meet Wikipedia’s notability expectations yet. In that case, focus on verifiable business milestones and independent coverage before attempting article creation.\"}},{\"@type\":\"Question\",\"name\":\"Should I publish the page myself?\",\"acceptedAnswer\":{\"@type\":\"Answer\",\"text\":\"Direct publishing can be risky when there is a conflict of interest or the sourcing is weak. A careful review of sources, neutrality, and applicable disclosure guidance is recommended before choosing how to proceed.\"}}]}}c:[[[\